# Production cluster parameters: pitch 200 -> cluster size 20000, expand margin 1000.
# n1 and n2 abut along x=20000, which is a short (reported as the zero-area overlap).
# n0 touches neither; it only moves the cluster origin to (0,0), which puts a
# cluster boundary exactly on x=20000. The short must still be reported.
case metal_short_on_cluster_boundary
die 0 0 100000 100000
routing M1 dir=H pitch=200
cut V1
rule metal_short
result n0 M1 0 0 100 100
result n1 M1 19000 0 20000 100
result n2 M1 20000 0 21000 100
expect metal_short M1 20000 0 20000 100 nets=n1,n2 required=0
